why The Water Totem that lets you place water totems, and Healing Stream Totem with it.

# Call of Water for Horde Shamans: your trainer -> Islen Waterseer south of
# Ratchet -> Brine's three waterskins (the quilboar watering hole below her
# hut, the Spring Well in Tarren Mill, the Ruins of Stardust fountain in
# Ashenvale) -> Islen (Water Sapta) -> the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine
# Forest -> Islen, who teaches Healing Stream Totem and gives the Water Totem.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (the fill
# objects); Forever's quest data for the rewards
# (quest 96: Healing Stream Totem and the
# Water Totem; 220: Water Sapta).
# The four openers (1528 Searn Firewarder in Orgrimmar, 1529 Xanis Flameweaver
# in Thunder Bluff, 2985 Swart in Razor Hill, 2986 Narm Skychaser in Bloodhoof
# Village) exclude one another; this guide takes the city trainers': Orgrimmar
# for Orcs and Trolls, Thunder Bluff for Tauren and Skyborne.
# The Horde leveling guides already carry this chain as class-only steps,
# spread from 20 to the low 30s (forever/horde/04-the-barrens to
# 30-40/02-stranglethorn-vale); this guide does it in one go, for anyone off
# the route or wanting Healing Stream Totem sooner.
# Water Sapta (972) and Tiev Mordune's Call of Water (1103, by the brazier)
# replace a lost Water Sapta: not steps.

step Searn Firewarder
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20 Searn Firewarder in the Valley of Wisdom sends you to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.
  accept 1528                                 -- Searn Firewarder

step Xanis Flameweaver
  only Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 20 Xanis Flameweaver, a shaman trainer in Thunder Bluff, sends you to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.
  accept 1529                                 -- Xanis Flameweaver

step Islen Waterseer
  zone The Barrens
  tip Islen waits on the hill south of Ratchet.
  turnin 1528 only Orc,Troll                  -- Islen Waterseer
  turnin 1529 only Tauren,Skyborne            -- Islen Waterseer
  accept 1530

step Brine
  tip Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole, south of Camp Taurajo.
  turnin 1530                                 -- Brine
  accept 1535
  collect 7769 quest 1535.1                   -- Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the quilboar watering hole
  turnin 1535
  accept 1536

step The Spring Well
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades and travel south to Tarren Mill. The Spring Well stands beside the inn.
  collect 7771 quest 1536.1                   -- Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well

step Brine
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1536                                 -- Brine
  accept 1534

step The Ruins of Stardust
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust, in south-western Ashenvale.
  collect 7770 quest 1534.1                   -- Fill the Empty Blue Waterskin at the fountain

step Brine
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1534                                 -- Brine
  accept 220                                  -- the Vial of Purest Water, for Islen

step Islen Waterseer
  turnin 220 reward 6637                      -- Islen Waterseer: your Water Sapta
  accept 63

step The Brazier of Everfount
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Fly to the Sepulcher: the Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it. Drink the Water Sapta there, beat the Corrupt Minor Manifestation of Water for its bracers and place them in the brazier, then speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen.
  use 6637 @38.3,44.6                         -- Water Sapta
  collect 7812 quest 63.1                     -- Corrupt Manifestation's Bracers
  turnin 63                                   -- Brazier of Everfount
  accept 100
  turnin 100                                  -- Minor Manifestation of Water
  accept 96

step Islen Waterseer
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 96 reward 5177                       -- Islen Waterseer: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem
